.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt SAY 1
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm say
.Nd speak text
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl v Ar voice
.Op Fl r Ar rate
.Op Fl o Ar file
.Op Fl f Ar file | Ar message
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
speaks
.Ar message ,
or the text of the file given with
.Fl f
.Pq Ql - : standard input ,
or standard input.
The voice is made by eSpeak NG, a program of its own
.Pq Pa /usr/libexec/espeak-ng ,
in the user's first preferred language unless
.Fl v
names another.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl v Ar voice
A voice's name, a language
.Pq Cm es
or a locale
.Pq Cm es_MX ;
.Fl v Ql \&?
lists the voices.
.It Fl r Ar rate
Words a minute.
.It Fl o Ar file
Keep the speech in
.Ar file
instead of playing it: AIFF, or WAV for a name that ends in
.Pa .wav .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr afplay 1
